Propagate scalar-string allocation failure before copying bytes.

The private string-clone helper reports allocation failure through a bool
result. Its only caller returns NULL before assigning the string. Public
DeepClone returns NULL and DeepCopy returns false through their existing
status paths. Empty strings retain their existing representation.

Origin: EmberBSD local adaptation. Prepared with AI assistance.
Upstream status: not submitted.

--- upb/message/copy.c.orig
